# Primary Vehicle Photo Branding Feature Plan

We will implement a feature where marking a vehicle photo as "primary" automatically applies branding (top and bottom banners) to a copy of the photo, updates the public path to point to the branded copy, and backs up the raw original path to `original_path`. When a photo is unmarked as primary, it is reverted back to its raw original image, and the branded copy is deleted to save disk space.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Composer Packages**: We will install `intervention/image` and `intervention/image-laravel` to support Intervention Image v3 with Laravel facades.
> - **Testing Compatibility**: We noticed that test runs fail on SQLite because of MySQL-specific `FULLTEXT` query index creation in an existing migration `2026_03_04_232514_create_vehicle_notes_table.php`. We propose guarding this DB statement so it only executes when using the `mysql` driver. This will fix the test environment.

