### Core Logic Updates

#### [MODIFY] [SetPrimaryPhotoAction.php](file:///c:/Users/raihan/Herd/shokh/app/Actions/Inventory/SetPrimaryPhotoAction.php)
- Implement database transaction.
- Check and revert the old primary photo of the vehicle: restore its path/URL to `original_path`, delete its branded file, and nullify `original_path`.
- Apply branding (top and bottom banners) to the new primary photo using Intervention Image v3 (`Image` facade).
- Store the branded image as `<original_name>_branded.<extension>` in the same folder.
- Update database record for the new primary photo: set `is_primary` to `true`, store the backup raw path in `original_path`, and save the branded path and url in `path` and `url`.

